  "articleBody": "Hiring a crew to paint your garage requires more scrutiny than standard interior rooms because garages endure heavy abuse, vehicle exhaust, and moisture swings. Overview: Professional garage painting restores stained walls, protects masonry, and brightens up the space. Key Benefits: Quality coatings resist chemical spills, withstand regular washing, and brighten working light. Process Breakdown: The crew cleans and degreases surfaces, patches drywall holes or efflorescence, sands surfaces, applies dedicated primers, and lays down compatible topcoats with adequate airflow. Real Examples: A homeowner in Centennial had peeling paint from high humidity; prepping the masonry, using moisture-tolerant primers, and ventilating during cure solved the issue completely. Questions to Ask Before You Decide: Inquire what prep methods they use on oil stains, what primers are specified for drywall versus concrete, how they handle drying ventilation, and whether homes built before 1978 follow lead-safe containment rules. HH Remodeling LLC provides meticulous interior painting and drywall repair across the Denver metro. Call Abraham at 303-505-0866 to get started.",
  "datePublished": "2026-10-23"
}